[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0522","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0522.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0469","title":"Selena Sol WebBanner 4.0 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Selena Sol WebBanner 4.0 产品中存在严重的路径遍历漏洞，该软件在处理用户请求时未能有效验证路径输入，导致攻击者可通过发送包含 \"../\" 目录遍历序列的恶意请求绕过访问控制。攻击者可利用这一漏洞读取目标服务器上的任意文件，包括敏感系统配置文件、用户凭证、数据库连接信息等安全数据。漏洞影响 WebBanner 4.0 所有版本，攻击者无需任何权限即可远程实施攻击，但需精确知道目标文件路径，攻击复杂度较高。该漏洞同时影响系统机密性、完整性和可用性，潜在损失可能导致企业数据泄露、系统被攻破等严重后果。微软及相关安全厂商已确认此漏洞并发布相关安全补丁，建议用户及时升级到最新版本以获取防护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0469"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-02T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:48.070","remediation":"升级 Selena Sol WebBanner 至 4.0 以上修复版本，或在 Web 服务器配置中启用路径规范化检查、禁用目录遍历（如 Apache 配置 AllowOverride None 并限制 FollowSymLinks）。若无法升级，建议在 Web 应用防火墙配置规则拦截包含 ../ 或 ..\\\\ 的请求路径，并限制 Web 服务进程对敏感目录的读取权限。建议升级至 WebBanner 4.1 或更高版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1347","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-06-22&msg=ILENKALMCAFBLHBGEOFKGEJCCAAA.jwesterink%40jwesterink.daxis.nl","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=4.2.0.58.20000620193604.00979950%40mail.clark.net","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0469.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0469","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0469.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0469.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gvxh-v3hv-2g35/GHSA-gvxh-v3hv-2g35.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0469.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3266a44e-62ce-4c10-96b9-186c4c33489b.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/72eb3babf4053f474a6fa1578cb387378535ac53/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0522.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0096","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0096.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0112","title":"Debian GNU/Linux MBR 默认配置安全漏洞","description":"Debian GNU/Linux 默认安装过程中使用了不安全的 MBR（主引导记录），本地攻击者可在系统安装阶段通过软盘启动系统，绕过已有安全限制。该漏洞影响 Debian GNU/Linux 默认安装配置，属于本地权限提升漏洞，攻击者需要物理接触目标系统并具有软盘引导权限，利用方式为通过软盘引导进入系统后获取未授权访问。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0112"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-02T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:01.543","remediation":"安装 Debian GNU/Linux 时在 BIOS 中设置启动密码并将首选启动设备设为硬盘，禁止从软盘/CD-ROM 引导。完成安装后立即移除可移动介质并在 BIOS 中禁用软盘启动，同时设置物理安全策略限制本地控制台访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94973075614088&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/960","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40188c20a9aa81abfbfb911b27fe583dd73cd29e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0112.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0112","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0112.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0112.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/35654e096c2a49809e9bb5907f49e27c931fdaa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-992g-c72f-vm8c/GHSA-992g-c72f-vm8c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0112.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001146.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ca03f6ab-f187-46e1-8849-8042206df44e.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0096.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0001","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0114","title":"Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 匿名账户名称信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 中存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 `/_vti_bin/` 虚拟目录下的 `shtml.dll` 发送特制的 RPC POST 请求，获取服务器上匿名账户的名称。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，获取的信息可用于进一步的社会工程学攻击或系统渗透。该漏洞影响运行 FrontPage Server Extensions 的多种 Windows 平台，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0114"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-02T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:01.787","remediation":"立即卸载 FrontPage Server Extensions（FPSE）组件，该产品已停止维护，继续使用存在信息泄露风险。如业务必须保留，在 IIS 管理器中删除 /_vti_bin/ 虚拟目录的匿名访问权限，仅允许经过身份验证的用户访问，并使用 URLScan 工具过滤对 shtml.dll 的 RPC POST 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0114","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2000/CVE-2000-0114.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0114.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/75714a8ac899a2d78a02cc77946dc01b2cac6c38/2000/CVE-2000-0114.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1c48d2f992abe8752e6b0132b36baf70af48d1d3/http/cves/2000/CVE-2000-0114.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/low/cve-2000-0114-1296.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2000-0114-1297.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Internet%20Information%20Services%EF%BC%88IIS%EF%BC%89/CVE-2000-0114.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2000-0114-1297.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2000-0114_8.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0114","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/edba2e8a11daaad31ff57bea0f9419186eb54326/2000/README.md","https://github.com/Cappricio-Securities/CVE-2000-0114","https://github.com/adhamelhansye/CVE-2000-0114","https://github.com/Josekutty-K/frontpage-server-extensions-vulnerability-scanner"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0001.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0406","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0136","title":"Cart32/QuickCommerce/Shop Express/StoreCreator 购物车系统隐藏表单字段信息修改漏洞","description":"Cart32、QuickCommerce 等多款网上购物车应用存在隐藏表单字段未受保护的安全漏洞。远程攻击者可通过修改 HTML 表单中的隐藏字段值（如商品价格、数量、订单金额等敏感信息）来操纵交易数据，实现低价购买或篡改订单内容。该攻击无需身份认证，仅需向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可实施。受影响版本包括 Cart32 2.5a/3.0、QuickCommerce 2.5/3.0、Shop Express 1.0 及 StoreCreator 3.0 等，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0136"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:04.510","remediation":"升级到已修复隐藏表单字段信任问题的软件版本；若厂商已停止支持，应迁移至仍受支持的购物车系统。核心修复措施为服务端对所有表单提交参数（包括隐藏字段）进行完整性校验，将价格/数量等敏感数据存储于服务端 Session 而非 HTML 隐藏字段，防止客户端篡改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0136","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19951","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ac21ad6117514c2d2073c3d7d77e898bf2697d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0136.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0136","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/c30129e429a112fe5adcfb17ae2ff1b4c379d385/2000/CVE-2000-0136.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0136.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/986f88b713cae42a05d283e54e6fe229a76d2603/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h9x3-27xw-3788/GHSA-h9x3-27xw-3788.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0136.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88307/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0520970a-aa78-4989-ab6b-04a33f5e042e.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0406.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0406.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0400","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0133","title":"H. Nomura Tiny FTPd 多个缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"H. Nomura Tiny FTP Daemon 0.52 beta3 的多个命令处理函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务器发送特制的 STOR、RNTO、MKD、XMKD、RMD、XRMD、APPE、SIZE 及 RNFR 等命令参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致目标系统以服务进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重，影响 Tiny FTPd 0.52 beta3 版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0133"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:04.157","remediation":"立即停止使用 Tiny FTPd 0.52 beta3，该软件已停止维护多年且无安全补丁可用。迁移至 vsftpd（Linux）或 FileZilla Server（Windows）等持续维护的 FTP 服务器软件，并确保仅对可信网络开放 FTP 服务。如在边界防火墙上阻止外部对 TCP 端口 21 的访问，可将攻击面降至最低。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/961","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19737","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbe4faa82ea56a60f688d9bd92ecf2ac8f256a8a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0133.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2006/CVE-2006-7007.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0133","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0133/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0133.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0133.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/adcfef9b65b946e8e253b7ae8cc7b9873faa0681/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-fhqg-mpm6-q7p8/GHSA-fhqg-mpm6-q7p8.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ftp_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/6fc70e99720028e77c4408c5d66b921e62d4ec8a/CVE-2006/CVE-2006-70xx/CVE-2006-7007.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0400.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0141","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0141.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0157","title":"NetBSD VAX ptrace 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"NetBSD 系统在 VAX 架构上的 ptrace 调试接口存在权限检查缺陷，本地攻击者可通过调试进程修改 PSL（处理器状态长字）寄存器内容，从而绕过系统权限限制获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 NetBSD 多版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。利用条件为拥有本地 shell 访问权限，无需额外认证。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0157"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:07.147","remediation":"升级 NetBSD 至 1.4.2 及以上版本（该版本修复了 ptrace(2) 允许调试进程修改 VAX PSL 的问题），或在无法升级时移除受影响用户的 ptrace 操作权限，限制可登录 VAX 主机的本地用户范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/992","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0157.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0157","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0157.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0157.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-w7c5-7mg3-xjw5/GHSA-w7c5-7mg3-xjw5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0157.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001144.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0141.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0135","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0135.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0151","title":"GNU make 符号链接漏洞","description":"GNU make 在处理从标准输入读取的 Makefile 时，会跟随符号链接（symlink）而非读取实际文件内容，本地攻击者可通过创建恶意的符号链接指向其他用户的 Makefile，诱使目标用户在受影响目录下运行 make 命令，从而以目标用户权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 GNU make 各版本，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0151"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:06.407","remediation":"升级 GNU make 至 3.79 及以上版本（3.78.1 及更早版本受影响），该版本已修复从 stdin 读取 Makefile 时错误跟随符号链接的问题。如无法立即升级，应避免在多用户共享目录中使用 `make -f-` 或类似从标准输入读取 Makefile 的方式，并确保 Makefile 所在目录的写入权限仅限受信任用户，以防止本地攻击者通过符号链接劫持 Makefile 执行任意命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/981","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6acfb9cecc7e37f5bf14164f693abec3417aeb06/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0151.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0151","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0151.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0151.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2p4f-5m6f-7653/GHSA-2p4f-5m6f-7653.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0151.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001143.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8de92ff9-6e53-4ada-8d6c-40f454e5e195.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/d49ed792663c6bbe758cf7f56c6f7fd7c4afcbb1/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0135.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0122","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0122.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0137","title":"CartIt 购物车应用隐藏表单字段信息篡改漏洞","description":"CartIt 购物车应用程序存在设计缺陷，远程攻击者可通过修改隐藏表单字段（hidden form fields）的值来篡改敏感交易信息，例如商品价格、数量或订单金额。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击者仅需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可实现低价购买或信息篡改，影响使用 CartIt 的在线购物系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0137"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:04.640","remediation":"在服务端对所有表单提交数据进行严格校验，购物车金额、数量等敏感数据应存储在服务器端会话中而非客户端隐藏表单字段。对所有客户端提交的价格/数量字段进行服务端重新计算和验证，确保与实际商品价格一致。如使用第三方购物车组件，应替换为支持服务端数据管理的方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0137","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0137.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ac21ad6117514c2d2073c3d7d77e898bf2697d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0137.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0137","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/c30129e429a112fe5adcfb17ae2ff1b4c379d385/2000/CVE-2000-0137.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0137.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0137.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88296/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3e910c6d0fff2c3163dd69b92eb626a214df8855/2000.tsv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0137.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0122.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0122.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0122.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0121","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0135","title":"Atretail 购物车应用隐藏表单字段敏感信息篡改漏洞","description":"@Retail 在线购物车应用程序存在安全设计缺陷，其商品表单中的价格、数量等敏感交易信息以 HTML 隐藏字段（hidden form fields）方式传递至服务端，而未在服务端进行有效的完整性校验。远程攻击者可通过拦截并篡改 HTTP 请求中的隐藏字段值（如将商品价格修改为任意金额），从而以极低价格完成订单，导致商家遭受经济损失。该漏洞影响 @Retail 购物车系统的多个版本，攻击条件简单，无需任何身份认证，仅需基本的网络通信能力即可实施。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0135"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:04.387","remediation":"@Retail 购物车应用存在隐藏表单字段可被篡改的问题，应立即在服务端对所有表单提交数据进行完整性校验，禁止信赖客户端提交的隐藏字段值（如商品价格、数量等敏感信息）。同时建议升级到已修复此问题的版本，或替换为仍受支持且经过安全审计的购物车系统。若无法升级，应通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）对请求中 hidden 类型字段进行强制校验规则拦截作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0135","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0135.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ac21ad6117514c2d2073c3d7d77e898bf2697d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0135.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0135","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/c30129e429a112fe5adcfb17ae2ff1b4c379d385/2000/CVE-2000-0135.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0135.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0135.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88332/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/76ed5b243a5ac75f8d2d512d1de509d415e3e7ba/2000.tsv","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/c30129e429a112fe5adcfb17ae2ff1b4c379d385/2000/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0121.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0121.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0120","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0120.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0134","title":"Check It Out 购物车隐藏表单域敏感信息修改漏洞","description":"Check It Out 购物车应用存在不安全隐藏表单字段漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可直接修改 HTML 表单中的隐藏字段值（如商品价格、数量等敏感购买信息），导致任意修改订单金额或欺诈交易。该漏洞影响 Check It Out 购物车系统，利用方式简单，仅需向目标服务器发送经篡改的 HTTP 请求即可实施攻击，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0134"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:0