6x 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务发送超长的 MKD（创建目录）或 CWD（切换目录）命令触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 WarFTPd 1.66/1.67 版本，攻击者无需认证即可利用，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0131"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:03.917","remediation":"升级 War FTPd 至 1.67-3 以上版本，官方已修复 MKD/CWD 命令缓冲区溢出问题。若无法升级，建议在防火墙或路由器层面限制对该 FTP 服务的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并禁用匿名写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94960703721503&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/4677","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/966","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19740","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0131.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbe4faa82ea56a60f688d9bd92ecf2ac8f256a8a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0131.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0131","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0131.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0131.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2f2b600b6067347440c628428f80fe3f9e3c004e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xwrw-m7f6-fqjx/GHSA-xwrw-m7f6-fqjx.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/DDI_warftpd_cwd_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2007/CVE-2007-1567.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0118.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0112","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0112.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0123","title":"Filemaker 购物车应用程序隐藏表单域信息修改漏洞","description":"FileMaker 购物车应用程序存在信息修改漏洞，攻击者可通过修改网页表单中的隐藏字段（hidden form fields）篡改敏感交易数据，如商品价格、数量或订单金额。该漏洞源于服务器端未对客户端提交的隐藏字段值进行校验，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，影响使用 FileMaker 购物车模块的电商网站，可能导致数据篡改和财务损失。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0123"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:02.893","remediation":"确保所有订单金额、数量等关键交易数据在服务端进行完整性校验，禁止仅依赖前端隐藏字段传递价格信息；升级到 FileMaker 最新受支持版本或迁移至安全性更高的电子商务平台，并实施服务端 session 管理机制防止篡改交易数据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0123","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2d894f23944bb9acf861e3c6e192d8f723b95560/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0123.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0123","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/188d63c0a7229de21afb50db15586e9fc8647d16/2000/CVE-2000-0123.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0123.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/37358611606378c1ef62b2ed4e6b7dfbe11dca04/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hjjc-2p9f-q24f/GHSA-hjjc-2p9f-q24f.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0123.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88346/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/bfaf704c84438cafe15e6437a0f1a5a66dbac893/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0112.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0112.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0112.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0107","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0107.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0121","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 回收站预创建文件夹漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 系统的回收站功能存在安全设计缺陷，本地攻击者可通过在 recycler 目录下创建包含受害者安全标识符（SID）的子目录，从而读取或修改其他用户的文件。该漏洞源于回收站对目录权限的访问控制不当，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用，影响范围限于 Windows NT 4.0 和 Windows 2000 系统。CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0121"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:02.643","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Windows 10 或 Windows Server 2019/2022 等受支持版本，从架构层面消除此漏洞。如无法升级，可禁用回收站功能或通过组策略限制 recycler 目录（%SystemDrive%\\RECYCLER）的写入权限，仅允许 SYSTEM 账户完全控制，并在本地安全策略中禁止非管理员交互式登录。临时缓解措施：使用 ICACLS 命令 `icacls %SystemDrive%\\RECYCLER /inheritance:r /grant SYSTEM:F Administrators:F /deny Users:(W)` 限制普通用户对回收站目录的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ248399","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/963","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-007","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19739","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2d894f23944bb9acf861e3c6e192d8f723b95560/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0121.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0121","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0121.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100